### Improvement Plan — Prioritised

#### P1 — Critical (fix before production)

| ID | Finding | File | Change |
|----|---------|------|--------|
| **P1-1** | `store_incident()` called unconditionally — every normal reading creates an Incident row | `comprehensive_pipeline.py:378` | Gate on `if is_anomaly:` |
| **P1-2** | `setattr`/`getattr` dynamic tracker cache — unbounded memory leak (one attribute per tenant) | `comprehensive_pipeline.py:501–534` | Replace with `self._tracker_cache: dict[str, tuple[...]]` in `__init__` |
| **P1-3** | `LearningState.state_json` has no row-level lock — concurrent writes lose updates under Postgres | `learning_state_store.py:32–57` | Add `SELECT … FOR UPDATE`; plan `ewma_pot_state` dedicated table |

#### P2 — High (fix before adding subsystems)

| ID | Finding | File | Change |
|----|---------|------|--------|
| **P2-1** | EWMA tracker in `GasAnomalyDetector.detect()` never calls `update()` — frozen static threshold | `gas_anomaly_detector.py:168` | Add `ewma_tracker.update(z_score)` after `is_anomaly()` call |
| **P2-2** | `logger.debug` hides DB persistence failures — adaptive thresholds silently degrade | `comprehensive_pipeline.py:305,341,518,554` | Change to `logger.warning`; escalate to `logger.error` after N failures |
| **P2-3** | `db.rollback()` in `_save_trackers` scoped to full session — could undo unrelated work | `comprehensive_pipeline.py:555` | Replace with `async with db.begin_nested():` savepoint |
| **P2-4** | Gas EWMA is per-request only — no cross-request adaptation, mathematically identical to z-score | `gas_anomaly_detector.py:116–120` / `gas_anomalies.py:76` | Remove EWMA from `GasAnomalyDetector`; z-score + IQR is sufficient |
| **P2-5** | `fault_type` is unconstrained `String(32)` — any string can be stored | `schemas/incidents.py`, `db/models.py` | Add Pydantic `field_validator` + Alembic CHECK constraint |

